\label{thm101main}
Let ${f} \in \mathrm{Lip}_{\mathrm{loc}}(\mathbb{R})$, and let $\Sigma$, $\Gamma_{D}$, and $\Gamma_{N}$ be as defined above. Suppose that $0 < \beta < \alpha \leq \pi$ and
\begin{equation} \label{Yao0106}
