ref_dict.T:lin&EMD:
\begin{theorem}[{\cite[\S 5]{GO26}}]\label{T:lin&EMD}
For every finite metric space $X$, the equality
\[c_1(\emd(X))=c_1(\tc(X)) = c_{1,{\rm lin}}(\tc(X))\] holds, where $c_{1,{\rm lin}}(\tc(X))$ denotes the infimal distortion among all $m\in\N$ and all {\it linear} maps $f: \tc(X) \to \ell_1^m$.
